  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Climate Resilient Rural Livelihoods Programme</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Increased climate resilience and well-being of rural communities through improved food security and nutrition, economic empowerment, responsive local government policies and more inclusive and stronger grass-roots organisations. This will be achieved by diversified and increased agricuture production, increased seed security, better livestock management, sustainable management of resources, capacity building of grassroots organisations and policy work at local, national and international level.</narrative>
  </description>
